+	depends on OF && GPIOLIB && REGULATOR && POWER_SUPPLY
+	help
+	  Own the accessory detect and active-low charging GPIO inputs,
+	  debounce detection IRQs and pair wake IRQ setup across sleep.
+	  With the controller compatible, use an exclusive GPO3 regulator
+	  and pair factory policy with USB source and display blank events.
+	  Unknown accessory input-current capability does not raise USB budgets.
+
 endmenu
